	(descr "Molex SPOX 5267-03A (22-03-5035) vertical header with its housing turned 180 degrees on the pads of KiCad's Molex_SPOX_5267-03A_1x03_P2.50mm_Vertical, so the bevelled corner and the near wall are at pin 1. Pads as stock. For a header keyed like the Waveshare General Driver's H5 (D at the bevelled corner), so a stock servo lead joins pin 1 to H5's D (biped-robot #342). Molex drawing: http://www.molex.com/pdm_docs/sd/022035035_sd.pdf")
